915 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 150 0 R
/T (The simple design assumes a single rollover whenever the current reading is less than the previous reading. It cannot distinguish a genuine rollover from a meter reset, data-entry mistake, or multiple missed cycles. It also uses one tariff for the whole billing period and does not yet account for taxes, subsidies, meter faults, or time-of-day usage. These cases require additional rules and records.)
/E (The simple design assumes a single rollover whenever the current reading is less than the previous reading. It cannot distinguish a genuine rollover from a meter reset, data-entry mistake, or multiple missed cycles. It also uses one tariff for the whole billing period and does not yet account for taxes, subsidies, meter faults, or time-of-day usage. These cases require additional rules and records.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
