/T (Retain integer paise and wide integer totals, but modify the program to separate the tariff configuration from the source code. Use a validated configuration file for rates, explicit error handling, a rollover/reset check, and automated boundary tests. The recommendation should be supported by actual compiler runs and measured totals recorded in the submission.)
/E (Retain integer paise and wide integer totals, but modify the program to separate the tariff configuration from the source code. Use a validated configuration file for rates, explicit error handling, a rollover/reset check, and automated boundary tests. The recommendation should be supported by actual compiler runs and measured totals recorded in the submission.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [11]
>>
