922 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 150 0 R
/T (For a small fixed tariff, symbolic constants are simple and fast. However, changing a #define value requires recompilation and redistribution. Since the co-operative expects tariff revisions, a configuration file is more suitable. At program start, the program should read the fixed charge, slab limits, rates, and effective date, validate that values are non-negative and ordered, and reject an invalid configuration. Keep a versioned backup and an audit record for every approved revision.)
/E (For a small fixed tariff, symbolic constants are simple and fast. However, changing a #define value requires recompilation and redistribution. Since the co-operative expects tariff revisions, a configuration file is more suitable. At program start, the program should read the fixed charge, slab limits, rates, and effective date, validate that values are non-negative and ordered, and reject an invalid configuration. Keep a versioned backup and an audit record for every approved revision.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [12]
>>
