/E (1. Use unsigned integer types for validated meter readings and consumed units. 2. Store money as integer paise. 3. Use long long for the bill and aggregate totals, with an overflow check before adding each bill. 4. Define the meter range and tariff rules in one place. 5. Separate input validation, consumption calculation, tariff calculation, and output into functions as the program grows.)
