/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 151 0 R
/T (The original billing logic can be retained as a starting point, but the input model and tariff calculation must be modified. Instead of relying only on two monthly meter readings, the system should process time-stamped watt-hour interval records. The tariff configuration should be loaded from a file or database at start-up, with validation and a version/effective date.)
/E (The original billing logic can be retained as a starting point, but the input model and tariff calculation must be modified. Instead of relying only on two monthly meter readings, the system should process time-stamped watt-hour interval records. The tariff configuration should be loaded from a file or database at start-up, with validation and a version/effective date.)
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
945 0 obj
<<
